    "about_this_biz_bio": "Franklin has a strong passion for helping his clients with their needs. With over 10+ years of experience, his work includes dealing with tree removal, pruning, and specializes in hazardous trees. Whatever your tree needs are, Franklin will ensure the the quality of work is provided to improve the landscape of this client.",
    "about_this_biz_bio_first_name": "Franklin",
    "about_this_biz_bio_last_name": "R",
    "about_this_biz_history": "Green Lane Tree Services was started in hopes to keep providing this quality of service. Our business prides itself in not only the work we produce, but also the customer service when assisting our clients. We hold ourselves to the highest of standards when completing a job, just as we would expect to receive this as a client.",
    "about_this_biz_role": "Business Owner",
    "about_this_biz_specialties": "Complete tree services!  Tree removal,tree pruning, crownd reduce and more",
